OL,3,GNEWSAHow this summer may have been when
OL,4,Aclimate change felt real
OL,5,
OL,6,FIs this the year climate change became
OL,7,Freal for people of the Midlands?
OL,9,FI mean climate change is real, I've
OL,10,Fspent a 25-year career telling people
OL,11,Fit is real and documenting its impact
OL,12,Fon the region: Floods, dry spells,
OL,13,Fheatwaves and more.
OL,15,FSo why for many people does this year
OL,16,Ffeel different - like climate change is
OL,17,Ffinally "here" ?
OL,23,APub: 14-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,353,350,200,160,0,100
