OL,3,GNEWSAHow this summer may have been when
OL,4,Aclimate change felt real
OL,5,
OL,6,FWell in 2026, things have reached some
OL,7,Fsort of tipping point where we can
OL,8,Fstart to see really obvious signs of
OL,9,Fchange that had a huge impact on at
OL,10,Fleast some of us.
